  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> be the solution of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>.</mo></math> If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> is equal to ___."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>&#945;</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#8467;</mi><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#8467;</mi><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></msup><mi>&#945;</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Put <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#8467;</mi><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>From equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo></math> as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>)</mo></math>.</p>"
  }
